contentText:
The inaugural Bobby Weir Sustainability Awards were given out on Tuesday (April 14) at the third annual Music Sustainability Summit in Los Angeles.

Named in honor of the late Grateful Dead co-founder and created in partnership with his family , the awards honor those whose work integrating sustainability into the music industry has made a significant impact.

